WEBVTT

01:36.690 --> 01:39.950
[Northward]

01:40.080 --> 01:41.910
[Episod 19]

01:59.830 --> 02:00.830
Siyi.

02:07.220 --> 02:08.520
Kenapa awak belum balik rumah lagi?

02:28.180 --> 02:29.290
Saya bukan awak,

02:29.470 --> 02:30.790
jadi saya

02:30.810 --> 02:32.930
tak faham betapa sedihnya awak.

02:35.310 --> 02:37.710
Saya hanya rasa jika nenek masih hidup,

02:39.550 --> 02:41.230
dia pasti tak mahu awak begini.

02:42.560 --> 02:44.520
Nenek pasti mahu awak

02:46.190 --> 02:47.310
